":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-02-18T08:10:45Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/3933140908","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/3087#issuecomment-3933140908","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3087","id":3933140908,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz887qbves","user":{"login":"SymoHTL","id":54981573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTgxNTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54981573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL","html_url":"https://github.com/SymoHTL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-20T11:05:50Z","updated_at":"2026-04-19T19:14:17Z","body":" Can confirm this also affects regular (non-exit-node) ACL rules on v0.28.0.\n\n  Setup: Two nodes — one tagged (tag:gaming, tag:infra), one user-owned. Policy uses groups in `src` and `*:*` in `dst`:\n\n```json\n   {\n     \"groups\": {\n       \"group:home\": [\"owner@example.com\", \"user2@example.com\"]\n     },\n     \"acls\": [\n       {\"action\": \"accept\", \"src\": [\"group:home\"], \"dst\": [\"*:*\"]}\n     ]\n   }\n```\n\n  Result: PacketFilter: `[]` — empty filter, all TCP traffic blocked. tailscale ping works (bypasses filter), but real connections (e.g. Minecraft on port 25565) are dropped.\n\n  Replacing `group:home` with `*` in src immediately fixes it:\n\n```json\n   {\"action\": \"accept\", \"src\": [\"*\"], \"dst\": [\"*:*\"]}\n```\n  So the issue isn't limited to exit node restrictions — group-based src rules produce empty filters for any destination when tagged nodes are involved.\n\n  Using `{\"src\": [\"*\"], \"dst\": [\"*:*\"]}` as a workaround until v0.29.0.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/3933140908/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"SymoHTL","id":54981573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTgxNTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54981573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL","html_url":"https://github.com/SymoHTL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":22993891497,"node_id":"SE_lADOEFLz887rr4tgzwAAAAVaivCp","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/22993891497","actor":{"login":"avalls-smd","id":213762172,"node_id":"U_kgDODL3AfA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213762172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/avalls-smd","html_url":"http