pos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryclarke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryclarke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-05-08T13:29:59Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":25330907311,"node_id":"REFE_lADOEFLz887rr4tgzwAAAAXl1viv","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/25330907311","actor":{"login":"nblock","id":131119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTExOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock","html_url":"https://github.com/nblock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"34f7b4492ab484097253321b577461387307b8ab","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nblock/headscale/commits/34f7b4492ab484097253321b577461387307b8ab","created_at":"2026-05-09T03:14:54Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4413599789","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/3087#issuecomment-4413599789","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3087","id":4413599789,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz888AAAABBxIwLQ","user":{"login":"thenebu","id":74529933,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTI5OTMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74529933?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu","html_url":"https://github.com/thenebu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-09T20:27:16Z","updated_at":"2026-05-09T20:27:16Z","body":"Confirming on **headscale v0.28.0** with **tailscale 1.96.5 (macOS) / 1.96.4 (Linux) / latest iOS**.\n\nReproduction is independent of `dst` syntax — tested all of:\n\n- `dst: [\"<user>:*\", \"autogroup:internet:*\"]`\n- `dst: [\"<user>:*\", \"0.0.0.0/0:*\", \"::/0:*\"]`\n- `dst: [\"*:*\"]`\n- `dst: [\"*:*\", \"autogroup:internet:*\"]`\n\n…all produce the same end result: `tailscale status` shows `active; exit node;`, `AllowedIPs` on the client contains `0.0.0.0/0` for the exit-node peer, headscale routes are approved — but **0 data packets** ever reach the exit node (`tcpdump -i any -n 'host <client-tailnet-ip>'` on the exit node confirms). Tunnel itself is healthy: `tailscale ping --tsmp <exit-node>` and ICMP to the exit node's tailnet IP both work.\n\nTwo independent exit nodes tested to rule out host-specific issues:\n\n- One Debian 13 node co-located with the headscale server (per [FAQ warning](https://headscale.net/stable/about/faq/#can-i-use-headscale-and-tailscale-on-the-same-machine))\n- One pristine Debian 13 VPS with only tailscale installed, IP forwarding, UFW with `DEFAULT_FORWARD_POLICY=ACCEPT` and `default allow routed`, `ts-postrouting` MASQUERADE rule present (counter `0 packets, 0 bytes`)\n\nSame symptom on both. Two clients tested (macOS, iOS) — same symptom on both. So the issue is policy-side, not exit-node-side or client-platform-side.\n\nDaemon log on client during a ping attempt:\n\n```\nopen-conn-track: timeout opening (TCP <client-ip>:nnnn => 1.1.1.1:443); \n                                                          no associated peer node\n```\n\n…until ACL is changed away from `autogroup:internet:*`, after which the same flow logs `rejected due to acl` instead. Either way, packets never leave the client.\n\n`tailscale debug netmap` on the client shows the exit-node peer correctly with `AllowedIPs: [\"0.0.0.0/0\", \"100.64.0.x/32\", \"::/0\", ...]`, but the `PacketFilter` array contains zero rules where the client's own tailnet IP appears as a `Src` — so the wgengine has no allow-rule for client-as-source toward `0.0.0.0/0`, and silently drops.\n\nThis matches @SymoHTL's analysis exactly: our `src` is a user identity, our exit nodes are tagged — user-src + tagged-dst → empty effective filter for that flow.\n\nWill try the `src: [\"*\"]` workaround and report back.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4413599789/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"thenebu","id":74529933,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTI5OTMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74529933?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu","html_url":"https://github.com/thenebu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":25344387994,"node_id":"MEE_lADOEFLz887rr4tgzwAAAAXmpKua","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/25344387994","actor":{"login":"SymoHTL","id":54981573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTgxNTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54981573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL","html_url":"https://github.com/SymoHTL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"mentioned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-05-09T20:27:17Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":25344388005,"node_id":"SE_lADOEFLz887rr4tgzwAAAAXmpKul","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/25344388005","actor":{"login":"SymoHTL","id":54981573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0OTgxNTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54981573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL","html_url":"https://github.com/SymoHTL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SymoHTL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-05-09T20:27:17Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4414755593","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/3087#issuecomment-4414755593","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3087","id":4414755593,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz888AAAABByPTCQ","user":{"login":"thenebu","id":74529933,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTI5OTMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74529933?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu","html_url":"https://github.com/thenebu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-10T07:41:56Z","updated_at":"2026-05-10T07:41:56Z","body":"Workaround verified: replacing user/group `src` with `src: [\"*\"]` immediately makes the exit-node flow work end-to-end (`curl https://api.ipify.org` returns the exit node's public IP, ICMP/TCP to arbitrary internet hosts succeeds).\n\nFor anyone hitting this with a structured ACL who wants to keep peer-access restrictions and only open the exit-node path, this minimal-permission variant works:\n\n```hujson\n\"acls\": [\n  // existing user/group rules KEEP src: [\"user@\"] / [\"group:...\"]\n  // and KEEP dst restricted to peers (NOT \"*:*\", NOT autogroup:internet)\n  { \"action\": \"accept\", \"src\": [\"user@\"],        \"dst\": [\"user@:*\"] },\n  { \"action\": \"accept\", \"src\": [\"group:family\"], \"dst\": [\"group:family:*\"] },\n\n  // ONE additional rule with src: [\"*\"] just for internet egress via exit nodes\n  { \"action\": \"accept\", \"src\": [\"*\"], \"dst\": [\"autogroup:internet:*\"] }\n]\n```\n\nThe trade-off: `src: [\"*\"]` here grants every tailnet user the right to use any approved exit node. Peer-to-peer access between users stays restricted by the original rules.\n\nTested combinations that **do not** work (all produce empty effective filter for the user→internet flow when exit nodes are tagged):\n\n- `src: [\"user@\"], dst: [\"autogroup:internet:*\"]`\n- `src: [\"user@\"], dst: [\"*:*\"]`\n- `src: [\"user@\"], dst: [\"*:*\", \"autogroup:internet:*\"]`\n- `src: [\"group:...\"], dst: [...]` (any of the above)\n\nThe only `src` value that produces a non-empty filter is `[\"*\"]`. So #3087 isn't strictly limited to \"Restrict access to exit nodes per user or group\" as the title suggests — it's a more general issue with user/group-scoped src against tagged-dst nodes (which exit nodes typically are).\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4414755593/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"thenebu","id":74529933,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTI5OTMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74529933?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu","html_url":"https://github.com/thenebu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenebu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":25377984268,"node_id":"REFE_lADOEFLz887rr4tgzwAAAAXopU8M","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/25377984268","actor":{"login":"nblock","id":131119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTExOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock","html_url":"https://github.com/nblock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https